vestors remain cautious \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  MOF may conduct USD-buying, JPY-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  again to prevent such slides after doing so Sept. 15 for first time in more than 6 years. Absence of Sydney-based players due to holiday also "may keep the market a bit thinner than usual today," Iizuka says. (andrew.monahan@dowjones.com) [ 10-03-10 2044ET ]\par \par \uc2 4022   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020101004e6a40000h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
